OL,5,
OL,6,CG2022FThe final edition of Neighbours
OL,7,F(original series) airs on Channel 5.
OL,8,FThe programme had been on UK TV since
OL,9,FOctober 1986. The final edition was
OL,10,Fshown the previous evening in
OL,11,FAustralia. Many former cast members
OL,12,Freturned - most notably Jason Donovan,
OL,13,FKylie Minogue and Guy Pearce.
